{"id": "SEG_S0163_R000020_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000168_R000020_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:eca9aa4646621c5b43c02141d686ebeaabfe1720c670edb817fdedd61bcd595f", "file_id": "S0163", "scene_id": "SCN0133", "order": 4, "speaker": null, "translation": "От неё пахнет родным домом.", "status": "draft", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
{"id": "SEG_S0163_R000021_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000168_R000021_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:db49c2e4bf13056a988bfadd668e582161b0a7b46031927b0c69e496a60c75e6", "file_id": "S0163", "scene_id": "SCN0133", "order": 5, "speaker": null, "translation": "Сразу вскрываю коробку и начинаю в ней рыться.", "status": "draft", "flags": [], "confidence": "high"}
